cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Bangumi-syncer in academic work or build on it, please cite this repository."
title: "Bangumi-syncer"
abstract: >-
  A zero-dependency container that reads the fnOS (trim.media) media database
  read-only and syncs anime episode marks and collection status to Bangumi via
  OAuth. Supports multiple users, dry-run by default, human-reviewable matching,
  and a browser-based setup UI.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Bangumi-syncer contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wwb051221/Bangumi-syncer"
url: "https://github.com/wwb051221/Bangumi-syncer"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
keywords:
